      "writtenOn": "2022-01-12T18:39:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Sumeet,\n\nCan you please list the items needed for DPTF and explanation of each item? I want to go over the list and evaluate the approaches. It\u0027s better not to repeatedly transfer static data.\n\n\u003e So, these implemented under this single item.\n\nSplitting a command into small ones is a valid option. We want to group data returned by each command logically (so that each command can be utilized for multiple purposes). If we create a new command every time we have a new application (e.g. DPTF), we will end up lots of fat commands with overlaps.\n\nI think the overhead of sending 2 ~ 3 commands is negligible.",
      "parentUuid": "f1e634da_282c4987",
      "range": {
